        <updateDate>2025-02-05T15:31:46Z</updateDate>
        <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Sunshine Protection Act of 2025</strong></p><p>This bill makes daylight saving time the new, permanent standard time.</p><p>States with areas exempt from daylight saving time may choose the standard time for those areas.</p>]]></text>
      </summary>
